The '''Royal Compass''' is a {{Rare}} item which points players to the nearest [[Emissaries|Emissary]] while in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Royal Compass''' can be claimed once player reaches [[Commissions|Commission Milestones I]], which requires at least {{Green|5}} {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} [[Commissions]] to be completed.

== Usage ==
When the '''Royal Compass''' is used inside the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}, a line of green particles will appear. These particles make a straight line towards the nearest [[Emissaries|Emissary]].

Attempting to use the '''Royal Compass''' outside the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} will result in the following message.
{{Dialogue|&cYou can't use this here!}}

